mdl 1;
-- Increment 7, slice: the monolith no longer has an asset mirror (MonoAsset). Tickets and rosters of a slice asset are
-- found by the key copy the monolith now publishes (AssetSystemID); contacts by the asset's customer (CustomerPublicID).
-- SLA_Asset / ContactPerson_Asset cannot be published by the monolith any more (associations to an external entity).
drop external entity TicketManagement.MonoAsset;
create external entities from CoreSeam.CoreAPI into TicketManagement entities (Ticket, Roster, ContactPerson, SLA);
